        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 434TD, Traditional Egg Knob with Stepped Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA classic, the Traditional Egg Knob made by Omnia, has a timeless beauty that makes it a mainstay in the designer community. It has a chicness that is brought about by the less common egg shaped knob to make a knobset that is both traditional and a little unexpected. The stepped round rose paired with the egg shaped knobset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 434TD Traditional Egg Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 434TD Traditional Egg Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Egg Knob, Omnia 434TD",
                "description": "Traditional Egg Knob, Omnia 434TD - A classic, the Traditional Egg Knob made by Omnia, has a timeless beauty that makes it a mainstay in the designer community. It has a chicness that is brought about by the less common egg shaped knob to make a knobset that is both traditional and a little unexpected. The stepped round rose paired with the egg shaped knobset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in 8 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-434TD, Omnia Prodigy Traditional Egg Knobs, Omnia 434TD Traditional Egg Knobs, Egg Knob With Round Roses, Stepped roses, egg knobsets, Traditional knobs, classic knobs, Traditional knobsets, classic knobsets, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs,"
